#: includes/configs/settings.php:129
msgid "Enter an API key SID from the Twilio console. Twilio recommends API keys: a leaked key can be revoked on its own, without touching the rest of the account."
msgstr ""

#: includes/configs/settings.php:136
msgid "API Key Secret"
msgstr ""

#: includes/configs/settings.php:137
msgid "Enter the secret shown when the API key was created. Twilio only shows it once."
